OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission says Orange
OL,4,AOrder Drumcree parade can go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have gathered at the High
OL,7,FCourt in Belfast, where they intend to
OL,8,Fchallenge the decision
OL,10,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill said
OL,11,Fthere is "no reasonable or logical
OL,12,Fbasis" for the decision
OL,14,FDemocratic Unionist Party leader Gavin
OL,15,FRobinson described the decision as a
OL,16,F"significant and long-overdue
OL,17,Fbreakthrough"
OL,19,FDrumcree has been one of the most
OL,20,Fcontentious parades in Northern Ireland
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
